# Build context denylist. The Lore source is cloned at a pinned tag
# INSIDE the builder stage, so the image needs almost nothing from this
# repo's worktree — only the docker/ tree (s6 service + entrypoint) is
# COPYed in. This keeps the context buildx ships to the daemon tiny and
# guarantees nothing stray (secrets, certs, backups) can leak into a layer.

# Everything by default…
*

# …except the docker/ inputs the Dockerfile actually COPYs.
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/s6/**

# Belt-and-suspenders: never let credentials or backups into the context
# even if an `!` rule above gets loosened later.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/secrets/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/backups/**
**/.git/**
